title: Issue/Link Triage Flow
---
```mermaid
%%{init: {'theme':'dark','themeVariables':{'primaryTextColor':'#ddd','lineColor':'#9aa0a6'},'securityLevel':'loose'}}%%
flowchart TD
  A[New link/issue] --> B{Valid?}
  B -- No --> C[Close/Archive]
  B -- Yes --> D{Docs or Code?}
  D -- Docs --> E[Add to docs/authoring/qa]
  D -- Code --> F[Create bug/feature]
  E --> G[Review]
  F --> G
  G --> H[Done]

  style E fill:#263238,stroke:#546e7a
  style F fill:#263238,stroke:#546e7a
  style H fill:#1b5e20,stroke:#2e7d32
```
